cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cross-Modal Discordance Analysis for 30-Day Hospital Readmission Prediction"
abstract: >
  A three-stage readmission prediction pipeline combining XGBoost on structured
  EHR features (Stage 1), Clinical-Longformer on discharge notes (Stage 2), and
  cross-modal discordance analysis via phi4-mini (Stage 3) to characterise
  agreement and disagreement between structured and unstructured clinical data.
  Trained and evaluated on MIMIC-IV.
